WEBVTT

00:00:13.250 --> 00:00:14.730
Shiho!

00:00:15.090 --> 00:00:16.330
Over here, Shiho!

00:00:31.620 --> 00:00:33.370
Hurry, Shiho!

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:39.310
I'm sorry, Nagisa!

00:00:39.630 --> 00:00:41.230
It's okay... Forget it.

00:00:41.230 --> 00:00:43.250
You're missing too many shots, Shiho.

00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:47.320
Is last week's game still bothering you?

00:00:48.100 --> 00:00:51.630
I got over it already... 
I've forgotten about it.

00:00:51.630 --> 00:00:53.090
I hope so.

00:00:53.390 --> 00:00:56.460
We can't lose even one game now.

00:00:57.380 --> 00:01:02.310
Are you saying that it's my 
fault that we lost last week?

00:01:02.670 --> 00:01:04.570
I didn't say that.

00:01:04.570 --> 00:01:06.040
You just did.

00:01:06.040 --> 00:01:07.600
See? You haven't gotten over it.

00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:09.310
I have, too!

00:01:09.310 --> 00:01:11.270
Hey! What's wrong?

00:01:14.350 --> 00:01:16.950
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:01:16.950 --> 00:01:19.760
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:01:19.760 --> 00:01:22.590
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:01:22.590 --> 00:01:26.860
<i>We're pretty and cure cure Together we are...</i>

00:01:26.860 --> 00:01:29.830
<i>PRETTY CURE...!</i>

00:01:29.830 --> 00:01:32.700
<i>Out of the frying pan, into the fire</i>

00:01:32.700 --> 00:01:34.610
<i>Frankly, it's totally unbelievable</i>

00:01:35.810 --> 00:01:38.510
<i>Even in our school in our 
school uniforms, we're both</i>

00:01:38.510 --> 00:01:40.110
<i>amazingly tough</i>

00:01:41.610 --> 00:01:45.920
<i>Each time we get out of a tight spot, we both</i>

00:01:46.550 --> 00:01:48.020
<i>become stronger</i>

00:01:48.020 --> 00:01:51.790
<i>and closer</i>

00:01:52.790 --> 00:01:55.790
<i>Yeah! Your best! My best! Because we're alive</i>

00:01:55.790 --> 00:01:58.360
<i>we never fail!</i>

00:01:58.630 --> 00:02:01.530
<i>Don't you know that good fortune 
comes to the gates of laughter?</i>

00:02:01.530 --> 00:02:04.400
<i>Out with the negative!</i>

00:02:04.400 --> 00:02:10.680
<i>Brighten up your life!
Try with all your might...</i>

00:02:10.680 --> 00:02:11.580
<i>Work like the devil!</i>

00:02:11.580 --> 00:02:14.280
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:02:14.280 --> 00:02:17.080
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:02:17.080 --> 00:02:19.980
<i>We're pretty and cure cure</i>

00:02:19.980 --> 00:02:21.550
<i>Together we are</i>

00:02:21.550 --> 00:02:24.620
<i>Pretty Cure...!</i>

00:02:59.120 --> 00:03:00.260
It's frightening.

00:03:01.410 --> 00:03:06.100
It just shows how great Jyaku-King's 
power of darkness is.

00:03:06.600 --> 00:03:09.730
Then we'd better hurry and 
gather the power of the stones

00:03:10.040 --> 00:03:12.260
for Jyaku-King now that 
he's come back to life.

00:03:12.680 --> 00:03:15.740
There's no need to rush.

00:03:19.380 --> 00:03:23.950
"GET THE VICTORY! 
FIND THE PATH OF LIGHT WITH YOUR HEART"

00:03:24.620 --> 00:03:28.740
Isn't Shiho with you? Did something happen?

00:03:30.310 --> 00:03:32.760
I don't know what the reason is,

00:03:33.060 --> 00:03:34.690
but from the beginning of the week,

00:03:34.690 --> 00:03:36.960
she stopped spending time with us.

00:03:37.420 --> 00:03:40.320
I was thinking, maybe she found a boyfriend.

00:03:41.080 --> 00:03:43.110
What about you, Nagisa?

00:03:43.110 --> 00:03:45.020
No luck at all.

00:03:46.670 --> 00:03:47.720
You're wrong.

00:03:49.710 --> 00:03:50.650
What?

00:03:51.760 --> 00:03:54.450
Ever since she made that 
mistake at last week's game,

00:03:54.750 --> 00:03:57.170
she's been staying back 
to practice by herself.

00:03:58.360 --> 00:03:59.640
I didn't know.

00:04:00.230 --> 00:04:02.400
If she was going to stay back to practice,

00:04:02.400 --> 00:04:04.260
I would have stayed to practice with her.

00:04:04.690 --> 00:04:08.590
I told her that, but she 
said it was her mistake.

00:04:08.590 --> 00:04:12.040
But it was just that one play, wasn't it?

00:04:12.370 --> 00:04:15.120
I make lots of mistakes at every game.

00:04:15.120 --> 00:04:16.430
What are you saying?

00:04:17.440 --> 00:04:21.530
Not everyone is as shameless as you.

00:04:21.530 --> 00:04:22.330
What are you saying?

00:04:22.650 --> 00:04:25.930
I may not look it, but I am very sensitive.

00:04:25.930 --> 00:04:29.770
Sensitive? Let's just leave it at that.

00:04:29.770 --> 00:04:31.330
How mean!

00:04:31.330 --> 00:04:34.250
I think I can understand how Shiho feels.

00:04:34.930 --> 00:04:37.870
Ever since we joined the lacrosse team,

00:04:37.870 --> 00:04:39.410
Shiho and I have been close friends,

00:04:39.410 --> 00:04:42.520
trying our best to become 
a starter like you, Nagisa.

00:04:42.860 --> 00:04:46.840
When we both became starters 
in our second year,

00:04:46.840 --> 00:04:49.550
we were both so happy.

00:04:49.830 --> 00:04:55.650
That's why we may be too determined 
not to hold everyone back.

00:04:56.540 --> 00:04:59.240
I like Shiho's passes.

00:04:59.950 --> 00:05:01.940
You can feel her determination.

00:05:01.940 --> 00:05:04.780
It's so like her, and easy to catch.

00:05:09.690 --> 00:05:11.310
I'm late!

00:05:42.170 --> 00:05:45.180
Aren't you seriously worried about Shiho?

00:05:45.420 --> 00:05:49.190
That mistake she made during last 
week's game was pretty bad, wasn't it?

00:05:49.580 --> 00:05:53.790
At this rate, I'm worried about 
what'll happen at the league game.

00:06:01.810 --> 00:06:03.680
Kubota

00:06:04.680 --> 00:06:08.440
That mistake she made during last 
week's game was pretty bad, wasn't it?

00:06:09.160 --> 00:06:12.380
I'm worried about what'll 
happen at the league game.

00:06:16.490 --> 00:06:18.480
I'm going to be late for morning practice.

00:06:19.000 --> 00:06:22.640
I shouldn't have stayed up 
late watching television.

00:06:23.480 --> 00:06:24.420
Shiho!

00:06:26.840 --> 00:06:27.870
Shiho...

00:06:29.800 --> 00:06:31.540
Let's hurry, and go to morning practice.

00:06:33.440 --> 00:06:35.020
I'm not going today.

00:06:35.020 --> 00:06:36.850
Are you sick?

00:06:36.850 --> 00:06:38.180
Not really.

00:06:38.180 --> 00:06:39.830
Then, let's go!

00:06:39.830 --> 00:06:41.220
Just leave me alone!

00:06:41.980 --> 00:06:43.170
Shiho...

00:06:43.420 --> 00:06:46.490
I'm just a nuisance anyway.

00:06:47.020 --> 00:06:49.660
Are you still hung up on that game?

00:06:51.240 --> 00:06:54.480
It's no use thinking about what's past.

00:06:54.480 --> 00:06:56.150
Let's go to practice.

00:06:56.150 --> 00:06:56.900
No!

00:06:58.380 --> 00:07:04.200
I'm not as good as Nagisa, and I'm 
not fast on my feet like you, Rina.

00:07:04.650 --> 00:07:06.500
I thought it was my job to pass the ball

00:07:06.500 --> 00:07:08.450
so everyone can keep the ball in play,

00:07:08.880 --> 00:07:10.590
but look at what happened.

00:07:10.870 --> 00:07:12.900
No one thinks that.

00:07:12.900 --> 00:07:17.300
No... I know that I'm 
just no good at lacrosse.

00:07:17.300 --> 00:07:19.050
That's what everyone thinks.

00:07:19.050 --> 00:07:21.380
Why are you so insecure?

00:07:21.980 --> 00:07:23.690
It's not like you!

00:07:24.220 --> 00:07:25.950
Worrying yourself to death.

00:07:25.950 --> 00:07:27.200
Convincing yourself that you're no good.

00:07:28.070 --> 00:07:29.880
If you're that unsure of yourself...

00:07:30.490 --> 00:07:32.380
If you're that unsure of yourself, then...

00:07:33.500 --> 00:07:34.880
Why don't you quit?

00:07:36.230 --> 00:07:37.740
Just quit!

00:07:38.090 --> 00:07:39.500
All right! I will!

00:07:45.420 --> 00:07:46.770
I'm late!

00:07:56.880 --> 00:07:58.020
What's wrong?

00:07:59.240 --> 00:08:00.370
Nothing.

00:08:07.570 --> 00:08:09.380
Why are you sighing?

00:08:09.750 --> 00:08:11.330
It just came out.

00:08:13.390 --> 00:08:14.960
Yukishiro-san...?

00:08:14.960 --> 00:08:16.000
What is it?

00:08:16.370 --> 00:08:22.300
Did you ever say things you didn't mean 
when you had a fight with a friend?

00:08:22.740 --> 00:08:23.670
I have...

00:08:24.400 --> 00:08:27.480
So it's happened to you, too.

00:08:27.480 --> 00:08:29.550
What did you do when it happened?

00:08:29.800 --> 00:08:32.520
I didn't really do anything...

00:08:32.910 --> 00:08:38.280
I just realized what she thought she 
went too far, too, and she regretted it.

00:08:38.280 --> 00:08:40.130
She felt the same way?

00:08:41.710 --> 00:08:46.730
Thanks to that, I think we understand 
each other a lot better now.

00:08:51.400 --> 00:08:53.170
Let's play popo! Let's play popo!

00:08:53.170 --> 00:08:54.110
Let's play popo!

00:08:53.610 --> 00:08:56.250
Okay... just be quiet.

00:08:54.110 --> 00:08:56.970
Let's play popo! Let's play popo!

00:08:58.050 --> 00:09:00.670
Pollun? What's wrong?

00:09:02.220 --> 00:09:04.150
Is anyone there?

00:09:04.150 --> 00:09:05.950
Is that you, Senior?

00:09:05.950 --> 00:09:08.070
Pretty Cula...?

00:09:08.070 --> 00:09:09.520
It's Pretty CURE!

00:09:09.520 --> 00:09:11.430
That's what I said... Pretty CULA.

00:09:11.430 --> 00:09:12.590
I give up.

00:09:13.470 --> 00:09:15.260
What do you want?

00:09:15.260 --> 00:09:19.330
I have something to tell everyone.

00:09:19.790 --> 00:09:22.640
Jyaku-King, who was supposed to 
have disappeared into the darkness,

00:09:22.640 --> 00:09:24.890
has come back to life in the Dotsuku Zone.

00:09:24.890 --> 00:09:25.720
Then...

00:09:26.150 --> 00:09:30.410
We have Jyaku-King's great 
power of darkness behind us.

00:09:30.710 --> 00:09:35.080
Then that's what she meant 
when she said that...

00:09:35.580 --> 00:09:36.810
What are we going to do?

00:09:37.010 --> 00:09:41.470
That's why you have to be sure 
to protect Pretty Cula, Pollun.

00:09:41.970 --> 00:09:43.950
Just leave it to Pollun popo!

00:09:43.950 --> 00:09:45.460
I'll protect Pretty Cula popo.

00:09:45.770 --> 00:09:47.090
It's CURE!

00:09:47.470 --> 00:09:49.240
I'm worried.

00:09:54.350 --> 00:09:57.040
It's unusual for you to come see me, Shiho.

00:10:00.110 --> 00:10:02.860
I see the path of light popo.

00:10:03.960 --> 00:10:05.940
Did you hear something?

00:10:06.220 --> 00:10:07.840
Not really...

00:10:08.880 --> 00:10:10.380
What did you want?

00:10:13.480 --> 00:10:14.610
Shiho?

00:10:15.990 --> 00:10:20.020
I've been thinking about this 
for a long, long time...

00:10:21.200 --> 00:10:22.780
I'm going to quit lacrosse.

00:10:23.700 --> 00:10:24.980
You're kidding, aren't you?

00:10:25.330 --> 00:10:29.170
I'm no good at it... Rina said so, too.

00:10:29.470 --> 00:10:30.600
Rina did?

00:10:31.060 --> 00:10:35.520
You don't really believe that 
Rina meant what she said, do you?

00:10:35.810 --> 00:10:38.910
I'm sure Rina regrets what she said.

00:10:39.550 --> 00:10:40.800
I wonder...

00:10:41.300 --> 00:10:47.030
But I know that in order to win, the team 
feels they're better off without me.

00:10:47.300 --> 00:10:48.190
In order to win?

00:10:49.420 --> 00:10:52.540
It was my fault that we lost a 
game that we should have won.

00:10:53.370 --> 00:10:54.760
Is that what it was to you?

00:10:56.420 --> 00:11:00.620
Is that what the lacrosse team was to you?

00:11:00.620 --> 00:11:01.780
Nagisa...

00:11:02.600 --> 00:11:06.080
It's true that I'm really happy when we win,

00:11:06.550 --> 00:11:10.080
but I'm not playing lacrosse just to win.

00:11:10.480 --> 00:11:11.890
I love the feeling of being among friends

00:11:11.890 --> 00:11:13.090
who are all going toward the same goal,

00:11:13.090 --> 00:11:15.130
and working our tails off to reach that goal.

00:11:17.270 --> 00:11:22.390
Isn't that why you and Rina 
worked so hard together?

00:11:22.630 --> 00:11:25.660
If we lose even one player 
on the team, it would...

00:11:26.140 --> 00:11:29.750
it would be meaningless even if we won!

00:11:29.750 --> 00:11:31.130
But... I...

00:11:31.540 --> 00:11:33.800
...already made up my mind!

00:11:34.250 --> 00:11:35.390
Shiho!

00:11:55.220 --> 00:11:58.730
So it was true that Jyaku-King 
came back to life...

00:11:59.050 --> 00:12:02.460
But right now, I'm going 
to concentrate on the game.

00:12:03.110 --> 00:12:04.620
That's why I left Pollun home...

00:12:04.620 --> 00:12:05.700
He's still sleeping.

00:12:06.450 --> 00:12:08.230
You're going to have to deal with him later.

00:12:09.790 --> 00:12:11.400
Do your best, Nagisa.

00:12:12.380 --> 00:12:15.090
For the sake of my precious 
friend, we can't lose.

00:12:15.090 --> 00:12:16.240
Don't worry.

00:12:16.240 --> 00:12:19.430
I know you can bring everyone together.

00:12:24.880 --> 00:12:27.670
You mean she's really going to quit?

00:12:28.890 --> 00:12:31.310
What am I going to do? It's my fault.

00:12:31.840 --> 00:12:34.730
Be sure you win today!

00:12:35.020 --> 00:12:36.240
Oh, no! He's here.

00:12:36.240 --> 00:12:44.110
An unsightly loss like the last game is 
totally unsuitable for Verone Academy.

00:12:44.110 --> 00:12:47.250
On top of that, our opponent today 
is our long-standing rival,

00:12:47.250 --> 00:12:49.140
Otakaku Girls' Middle School.

00:12:49.140 --> 00:12:52.350
Be sure you win the game!

00:12:52.860 --> 00:12:54.920
He's as nasty as ever.

00:12:54.920 --> 00:12:59.140
We're going to get Shiho to regain 
her confidence with this game.

00:13:05.760 --> 00:13:09.090
The members on the Otakaku team 
are looking good, aren't they?

00:13:11.060 --> 00:13:12.280
I'm sorry!

00:13:14.120 --> 00:13:16.270
What are you doing, Kyoko?

00:13:16.700 --> 00:13:19.210
Did they have a girl like 
that on the team before?

00:13:19.210 --> 00:13:20.180
I don't remember.

00:13:23.360 --> 00:13:24.890
I'm sorry...

00:13:25.390 --> 00:13:26.160
Here you go.

00:13:28.050 --> 00:13:30.930
You're Misumi-san, aren't you?

00:13:30.930 --> 00:13:32.000
That's right.

00:13:32.280 --> 00:13:33.520
Will...

00:13:33.520 --> 00:13:36.860
Will you... take a picture with me?

00:13:37.790 --> 00:13:39.520
Sure... it's okay with me.

00:13:40.230 --> 00:13:41.960
Thank you!

00:13:41.960 --> 00:13:44.130
My camera's over on the other side...

00:13:44.480 --> 00:13:46.280
I have to hand it to you, Nagisa...

00:13:46.280 --> 00:13:49.620
You're even popular with 
the rival school's players.

00:13:49.910 --> 00:13:51.730
Stop it!

00:13:53.110 --> 00:13:55.040
Honoka... Honoka!

00:13:55.900 --> 00:13:57.020
What is it?

00:13:57.020 --> 00:13:59.700
I have a really awful feeling mipo!

00:14:00.170 --> 00:14:02.490
Something's coming mipo!

00:14:02.490 --> 00:14:03.780
Really?

00:14:03.780 --> 00:14:06.180
Let's go to Mepple mipo!

00:14:07.810 --> 00:14:09.900
How far are we going?

00:14:12.090 --> 00:14:14.140
The game's going to start.

00:14:14.140 --> 00:14:16.830
I want to fight here.

00:14:17.960 --> 00:14:19.080
I want to...

00:14:19.080 --> 00:14:20.380
I said...

00:14:25.100 --> 00:14:28.260
We're going to setting things right here.

00:14:28.480 --> 00:14:29.710
Popo!

00:14:29.710 --> 00:14:31.670
You're late, Nagisa.

00:14:33.000 --> 00:14:34.400
She's not around here.

00:14:34.400 --> 00:14:37.020
You can take her place, Megumi.

00:14:39.120 --> 00:14:40.080
Shiho?

00:14:41.090 --> 00:14:43.620
We're counting on you 
until Nagisa comes back...

00:14:43.620 --> 00:14:44.930
You'll have to hold them off.

00:14:46.570 --> 00:14:47.600
Okay...

00:14:48.070 --> 00:14:51.830
The game is going to start!

00:14:51.830 --> 00:14:54.590
I don't have time...

00:14:54.590 --> 00:14:56.430
...for this!

00:15:08.660 --> 00:15:11.950
You have some good moves even without 
transforming into Pretty Cure!

00:15:13.700 --> 00:15:16.270
Where's the power of the stones?

00:15:16.270 --> 00:15:17.520
We won't tell you!

00:15:18.910 --> 00:15:20.240
Honoka...!

00:15:22.910 --> 00:15:24.800
Nagisa!

00:15:38.520 --> 00:15:41.410
Dual Aurora Wave!

00:16:09.810 --> 00:16:12.220
Protector of the Light, Cure Black!

00:16:12.560 --> 00:16:15.080
Protector of the Light, Cure White!

00:16:17.230 --> 00:16:18.890
Together, we're Pretty Cure!

00:16:20.150 --> 00:16:22.270
Servants of the power of darkness...

00:16:23.260 --> 00:16:25.690
Go back to where you came from!

00:16:27.880 --> 00:16:28.720
Juna...

00:16:29.190 --> 00:16:31.490
You snuck off by yourself...

00:16:31.490 --> 00:16:33.070
Just don't get in my way.

00:16:33.070 --> 00:16:36.850
Hey! I don't have time to deal with you two!

00:16:37.850 --> 00:16:39.050
Shiho!

00:16:40.280 --> 00:16:41.100
Darn!

00:16:54.010 --> 00:16:57.090
Where did you hide the power of the stones?

00:16:57.090 --> 00:16:58.560
No popo!

00:16:58.970 --> 00:17:00.430
Like I said...!

00:17:00.790 --> 00:17:04.060
I don't have time to deal 
with the two of you!

00:17:06.020 --> 00:17:13.200
No popo!

00:17:21.570 --> 00:17:24.670
Accept the power of light popo!

00:17:44.500 --> 00:17:46.790
The Pretty Cure Rainbow Bracelet?

00:17:46.790 --> 00:17:47.750
Pollun?

00:17:47.750 --> 00:17:49.350
Where did it come from?

00:17:49.690 --> 00:17:51.240
We're in luck now!

00:17:55.870 --> 00:17:58.750
Power of hope... Take the will of light...

00:17:59.500 --> 00:18:02.130
And fight your way toward the future!

00:18:02.420 --> 00:18:05.420
Pretty Cure Rainbow Storm!

00:18:29.210 --> 00:18:30.650
Retreat!

00:18:39.140 --> 00:18:40.920
Oh no! We're losing.

00:18:40.920 --> 00:18:42.550
Hurry, Nagisa...!

00:18:42.550 --> 00:18:43.760
We have 5 minutes left.

00:18:44.860 --> 00:18:46.310
Leave the rest to me.

00:18:56.980 --> 00:18:58.300
Nagisa...

00:19:15.290 --> 00:19:17.370
We're going to win this game!

00:19:24.300 --> 00:19:25.440
Shiho!

00:19:29.770 --> 00:19:31.470
I have to hurry, and pass the ball.

00:19:31.790 --> 00:19:34.810
Shiho! Over here!

00:19:41.570 --> 00:19:42.460
Oh no!

00:19:45.150 --> 00:19:45.880
Rina!

00:19:47.470 --> 00:19:49.820
Go! Go!

00:19:53.820 --> 00:19:54.740
Shiho!

00:19:56.540 --> 00:19:57.770
Over here! Over here!

00:20:09.120 --> 00:20:10.700
I promise I'll catch it.

00:20:11.040 --> 00:20:12.770
Believe in your friends!

00:20:13.230 --> 00:20:14.660
Shiho!

00:20:16.890 --> 00:20:18.290
Nagisa!

00:20:21.330 --> 00:20:24.160
Yeah! I made the pass! I made it! I made it!

00:20:24.590 --> 00:20:26.390
Nice pass, Shiho!

00:20:26.390 --> 00:20:28.670
Shoot, Nagisa!

00:20:30.500 --> 00:20:31.630
It's no good.

00:20:36.340 --> 00:20:37.360
I see it!

00:20:38.160 --> 00:20:39.270
Shiho!

00:20:42.120 --> 00:20:43.770
Me...?

00:20:44.580 --> 00:20:46.690
Don't worry! You can do it!

00:20:55.320 --> 00:20:56.660
She did it!

00:20:56.660 --> 00:20:59.900
She scored! Magnificent!

00:21:02.120 --> 00:21:03.580
It went in...

00:21:12.190 --> 00:21:13.760
That was great, Shiho!

00:21:13.760 --> 00:21:15.030
I don't believe it!

00:21:15.030 --> 00:21:17.200
Before I knew it, it was in!

00:21:17.200 --> 00:21:18.850
You did it, Shiho.

00:21:18.850 --> 00:21:19.590
Do you think...

00:21:19.580 --> 00:21:22.230
I might be gifted...? Really gifted?

00:21:23.600 --> 00:21:25.360
You're back to being the old Shiho...

00:21:26.760 --> 00:21:28.080
Stop it... stop that.

00:21:30.520 --> 00:21:33.330
You don't have to cry, Rina.

00:21:34.110 --> 00:21:36.820
I'm sorry for what I said...

00:21:39.110 --> 00:21:41.070
I don't know what came over me, too.

00:21:42.520 --> 00:21:44.380
Thank you, Rina...

00:21:45.720 --> 00:21:47.650
Thank you, Nagisa.

00:21:55.110 --> 00:21:57.990
Even if we're apart, he can 
still do something like that.

00:21:58.250 --> 00:21:59.760
Thank you, Pollun.

00:21:59.760 --> 00:22:02.460
I can see the path of light popo.

00:22:02.790 --> 00:22:04.420
The path of light?

00:22:10.870 --> 00:22:14.100
Which did you foresee anyway, Pollun?

00:22:14.420 --> 00:22:15.480
Popo...

00:22:22.220 --> 00:22:25.260
<i>Ah- Let's go!</i>

00:22:26.090 --> 00:22:29.190
<i>Get you! L-O-V-E Love Love!</i>

00:22:29.190 --> 00:22:29.930
<i>Get you!</i>

00:22:29.490 --> 00:22:32.530
<i>I can't do this! I'd rather be a</i>

00:22:32.530 --> 00:22:35.570
<i>young lady than a fighter and</i>

00:22:35.570 --> 00:22:38.100
<i>Get you! Into a love love mode</i>

00:22:38.100 --> 00:22:42.140
<i>And melt your body and soul into sweets</i>

00:22:44.680 --> 00:22:47.910
<i>like chocolate parfait or handsome men</i>

00:22:47.910 --> 00:22:52.250
<i>I'm at the age to seriously 
fall head over heels in love</i>

00:22:52.250 --> 00:22:55.320
<i>I wanted to confess my love again today</i>

00:22:56.450 --> 00:22:59.820
<i>For the sake of the earth 
For the sake of everyone</i>

00:22:59.820 --> 00:23:06.330
<i>That's good, too, but haven't 
you forgotten something?</i>

00:23:07.430 --> 00:23:13.940
<i>I'm a teenager with a heart 
throbbing exciting dream</i>

00:23:13.940 --> 00:23:20.450
<i>I don't want to lose that 
normal everyday routine</i>

00:23:20.450 --> 00:23:23.180
<i>I just can't do this! 
It's romance rather than</i>

00:23:23.180 --> 00:23:26.420
<i>stress, isn't it?</i>

00:23:26.420 --> 00:23:28.590
<i>Get you! Into a love love mode.</i>

00:23:28.590 --> 00:23:32.190
<i>Isn't that the best source of power?</i>

00:23:32.190 --> 00:23:35.390
<i>I just can't do this! I'd rather cuddle</i>

00:23:35.390 --> 00:23:38.200
<i>than fight and...</i>

00:23:38.200 --> 00:23:40.430
<i>Get you! Into a love love mode</i>

00:23:40.430 --> 00:23:43.100
<i>That's the most peaceful way</i>

00:23:43.100 --> 00:23:49.670
<i>So why am I stuffing my face 
with chocolates like this?</i>

00:23:53.630 --> 00:23:55.280
It's the Autumn Sports Festival.

00:23:55.280 --> 00:23:56.990
My heart is on fire...

00:23:56.990 --> 00:23:59.170
I'll swallow everything and give a yell.

00:23:59.170 --> 00:24:00.290
You're gung ho, aren't you?

00:24:00.290 --> 00:24:01.360
You're talking about eating.

00:24:01.360 --> 00:24:02.270
The first thing is to eat...

00:24:02.270 --> 00:24:04.200
Not again? At a time like this!

00:24:04.360 --> 00:24:05.520
What is this?

00:24:05.520 --> 00:24:07.830
Don't interfere with our 
important Sports Festival.

00:24:07.830 --> 00:24:09.000
It's terrible! Nagisa!

00:24:09.000 --> 00:24:10.100
The relay is about to start!

00:24:10.100 --> 00:24:11.820
I haven't had lunch yet.

00:24:13.500 --> 00:24:16.130
"NAGISA BREAKS AWAY! 
THE BLAZING 'GACHINKO' RELAY!"

00:24:16.130 --> 00:24:18.250
By the way, the "gachinko" looks delicious.

00:24:18.250 --> 00:24:19.620
It's not something to eat.
